- action(n1, "start"): Hallucinates a step not documented in the source; the description explicitly states the first step is to "register for classes and obtain an invoice".
- action(n3, "submit form"): Payload omits critical source details; fails to faithfully reflect "fill out and submit the Educational Assistance Form".
